ed?","answer":"Routine work proceeds under current scoped mandates, accepted procedures, grants and evidence without another personal decision. Record the exact choice and reasons, resources and remaining duties. Similar past approvals do not create an unlimited rule; software cannot autonomously accept new material exposure merely to reduce interruptions.","answer_location":"capabilities.json#/source_question_contracts/42","source_contract_location":"04-human-operation.md#decision-timing-and-no-answer-behavior","trace_decision_location":"09-company-human-traceability.md#personal-authority-and-absence","related_capabilities":["CAP-02","CAP-19","CAP-33","CAP-43"],"supporting_contracts":[{"subject":"Mandate","location":"01-contract-kernel.md#7-core-relationships-and-exact-state-transitions","binding_note":"Definition, projection or composition retains its source contract; this trace creates no additional authority record."},{"subject":"Grant","location":"01-contract-kernel.md#7-core-relationships-and-exact-state-transitions","binding_note":"Definition, projection or composition retains its source contract; this trace creates no additional authority record."},{"subject":"DecisionRecord","location":"01-contract-kernel.md#4-intent-knowledge-rationale-and-events","binding_note":"Definition, projection or composition retains its source contract; this trace creates no additional authority record."},{"subject":"WorkflowDefinition","location":"work-knowledge-contracts.json#/records/WorkflowDefinition","binding_note":"Definition, projection or composition retains its source contract; this trace creates no additional authority record."}],"supporting_capability_contracts":["capabilities.json#/capabilities/1","capabilities.json#/capabilities/18","capabilities.json#/capabilities/32","capabilities.json#/capabilities/42"],"decision_refs":[{"id":"CHT-D09","location":"09-company-human-traceability.md#personal-authority-and-absence","status":"adopted-S1-contract-application; no new arc