 a packet."},"source":"planning/specification/capabilities.json#/source_question_contracts/46"},{"question_id":"F22-Q07","source_field":22,"question":"What happens when they change their mind?","answer":"Record an authenticated successor intent/decision with the changed reason and effective scope, revalidate dependent plans/resources and preserve originals. Sold promises and already released effects remain to perform or legitimately remedy. A changed taste is not incompetence; a material factual misunderstanding takes the separate competent-assistance path.","answer_location":"capabilities.json#/source_question_contracts/47","source_contract_location":"04-human-operation.md#decision-timing-and-no-answer-behavior","trace_decision_location":"09-company-human-traceability.md#personal-authority-and-absence","related_capabilities":["CAP-01","CAP-38","CAP-43"],"supporting_contracts":[{"subject":"IntentVersion","location":"01-contract-kernel.md#4-intent-knowledge-rationale-and-events","binding_note":"Definition, projection or composition retains its source contract; this trace creates no additional authority record."},{"subject":"PivotPlan","location":"capabilities.json#/record_types/PivotPlan","binding_note":"Domain view/extension; resolve through catalog record_bindings to the exact canonical type."},{"subject":"DomainAssessment","location":"04-human-operation.md#human-records-and-command-contract","binding_note":"Definition, projection or composition retains its source contract; this trace creates no additional authority record."}],"supporting_capability_contracts":["capabilities.json#/capabilities/0","capabilities.json#/capabilities/37","capabilities.json#/capabilities/42"],"decision_refs":[{"id":"CHT-D09","location":"09-company-human-traceability.md#personal-authority-and-absence","status":"adopted-S1-contract-application; no new architecture"}],"evidence_refs":[{"location":"04-human-operation.md#decision-timing-and-no-answer-behavior","kind":"selected-specification",