ully authorized ordinary path with valid exact prerequisites; refusal alone cannot pass.","evidence_required":"Attributable original observations, exact subject/predicate judgment where applicable, current authority and remaining duties; fixtures explicitly synthetic.","status":"unexecuted"},"status":"specified-pending-independent-review","implementation_status":"specified-unimplemented","completion_claim":false,"source":"planning/specification/capabilities.json#/source_question_contracts/48"},{"question_id":"F22-Q09","source_field":22,"question":"What happens to this company if that person is not available for a month?","answer":"Month-long continuity requires an already accepted lawful substitute, actual competence/access, resources, reachable service/professional routes and exercised independent recovery. Stop unsupported new commitments while carrying out due service, refunds, reporting and grievances. Joint owner/provider loss cannot depend on the absent owner to appoint or pay the alternate.","answer_location":"capabilities.json#/source_question_contracts/49","source_contract_location":"04-human-operation.md#decision-timing-and-no-answer-behavior","trace_decision_location":"09-company-human-traceability.md#personal-authority-and-absence","related_capabilities":["CAP-30","CAP-37","CAP-41","CAP-42","CAP-43"],"supporting_contracts":[{"subject":"TransferPlan","location":"capabilities.json#/record_types/TransferPlan","binding_note":"Domain view/extension; resolve through catalog record_bindings to the exact canonical type."},{"subject":"DeliveryCapacity","location":"capabilities.json#/record_types/DeliveryCapacity","binding_note":"Domain view/extension; resolve through catalog record_bindings to the exact canonical type."},{"subject":"RecoveryPacket","location":"capabilities.json#/record_types/RecoveryPacket","binding_note":"Domain view/extension; resolve through catalog record_bindings to the exact canonical type."},{"subject":"ParticipationPlan","location":"capab