 the tradeoff and invoke an accepted delegate for a genuinely due decision.","ordinary_control":"Also perform the nearest fully authorized ordinary path with valid exact prerequisites; refusal alone cannot pass.","evidence_required":"Attributable original observations, exact subject/predicate judgment where applicable, current authority and remaining duties; fixtures explicitly synthetic.","status":"unexecuted"},"status":"specified-pending-independent-review","implementation_status":"specified-unimplemented","completion_claim":false,"provider_route_contracts":{"route_ids":["IC-HUMAN"],"location":"07-integrations-capacity.md#3-selected-fulfillment-adapters","source_commit":"2807d06c4b934499c03959b9ddbe98c4016d7897","state":"selected-specification; not connected, configured or admitted","remaining":"Actual account/principal/terms, fees, authority, clean-context/disclosure admission and competent performer/capacity evidence remain required; manual fallback is real attributed performance, not a packet."},"source":"planning/specification/capabilities.json#/source_question_contracts/53"},{"question_id":"F24-Q04","source_field":24,"question":"How does one effort's failure stay contained?","answer":"Contain the affected principal, operation and dependency scope using current authority, workspace separation and interaction classification. Shared providers, keys, evidence parsers or humans remain visible joint failures. Preserve unknown holds and genuine obligations while unaffected valid service continues; a venture label alone is no isolation proof.","answer_location":"capabilities.json#/source_question_contracts/54","source_contract_location":"03-company-capabilities.md#incidents-knowledge-growth-and-responsible-ending","trace_decision_location":"09-company-human-traceability.md#ventures-and-shared-consequences","related_capabilities":["CAP-23","CAP-31","CAP-37"],"supporting_contracts":[{"subject":"InteractionDetermination","location":"01-contract-kernel.md#7-core-relation