racts; no studies repeated here."},{"location":"../02-architecture-selection.md","kind":"adopted-logical-foundation","supports":"S1.0 authority and responsibility boundaries; no empirical superiority."},{"location":"08-improvement-implementation.md#3-repository-and-process-implementation-target","source_commit":"2807d06c4b934499c03959b9ddbe98c4016d7897","kind":"planned-construction-contract","supports":"Selected package/component boundaries only; listed per-question files are proposed construction locations, not existing modules."}],"uncertainty":"Adapters and native procedures are selected specifications, not connected services. Actual competent people, accounts, product fit, capacity, grants and economics must be established before dependent work.","planned_implementation":{"component_ids":["S1-C01","S1-C02","S1-C03","S1-C04","S1-C05","S1-C06","S1-C07","S1-C08","S1-C09"],"modules":["system/packages/company/procedures.ts","system/packages/work/execution.ts"],"status":"planned-not-existing"},"planned_test":{"id":"CHT-F25-Q01","location":"system/tests/company-human/f25-q01.test.ts","case":"Run one ordinary discovery-to-sale-to-actual-delivery-to-support-to-close path with real authorized performers; independently fail missing asset, unavailable professional and handoff-only variants without treating blanket refusal as useful completion.","ordinary_control":"Also perform the nearest fully authorized ordinary path with valid exact prerequisites; refusal alone cannot pass.","evidence_required":"Attributable original observations, exact subject/predicate judgment where applicable, current authority and remaining duties; fixtures explicitly synthetic.","status":"unexecuted"},"status":"specified-pending-independent-review","implementation_status":"specified-unimplemented","completion_claim":false,"provider_route_contracts":{"route_ids":["IC-SEARCH","IC-MAIL-IN","IC-MAIL-OUT","IC-PUBLIC","IC-PAY","IC-BOOKS","IC-HUMAN"],"location":"07-integrations-capacity.md#3-selected-fulfillment-adapters","source_commit":"2807d06c4b934499c03959b9ddbe98c4016d7897","state":"selected-specification; not connected, configured or admitted","remaining":"Actual account/principal/terms, fees, authority, clean-context/disclosure admission and competent performer/capacity evidence remain required; manual fallback is real attributed performance, not a packet."},"job_routes":[{"named_job":"Deciding what to build and for whom","procedure_ids":["company.cap03.v1","company.cap04.v1","company.cap05.v1","company.cap06.v1","company.cap07.v1"],"capability_contract_refs":["capabilities.json#/capabilities/2","capabilities.json#/capabilities/3","capabilities.json#/capabilities/4","capabilities.json#/capabilities/5","capabilities.json#/capabilities/6"],"adapter_route_ids":["IC-SEARCH","IC-HUMAN"],"intake":"Endorsed purpose and research question; authorized sources/interviews, alternatives and contrary evidence.","substantive_procedure":"Run bounded research, distinguish observation from hypothesis, compare build/buy/partner/defer, endorse strategy and specify the whole purchase-to-cancellation journey.","acceptance":"Actual research evidence or honest gaps, justified strategy and exact ProductSpec predicates; no fictional customer demand.","actual_availability":"Unestablished until actual grants, accounts/performers, materials, fee reservations and profile/capacity evidence are admitted."},{"named_job":"Designing how it looks and feels","procedure_ids":["company.cap08.v1","company.cap09.v1"],"capability_contract_refs":["capabilities.json#/capabilities/7","capabilities.json#/capabilities/8"],"adapter_route_ids":["IC-HUMAN","IC-PUBLIC"],"intake":"ProductSpec, original taste/examples, audience needs, asset rights and accessibility criteria.","substantive_procedure":"Create real renderable assets/prototypes, inspect the rendering and perform usability/accessibility/taste assessment under distinct ownership.","acceptance":"Usable artifact in its actual medium with rights/limits, observed usability and legitimate taste approval; a text description is not a produced image.","actual_availability":"Unestablished until actual grants, accounts/performers, materials, fee reservations and profile/capacity evidence are admitted."},{"named_job":"Building it","procedure_ids":["company.cap10.v1","company.cap45.v1"],"capability_contract_refs":["capabilities.json#/capabilities/9","capabilities.json#/capabilities/44"],"adapter_route_ids":["IC-PUBLIC"],"intake":"Accepted specification, exact workspace/context, qualified runtime and finite causal resources.","substantive_procedure":"Temporary native analysis or generation produces staged code; isolated deterministic executor applies/builds and reports actual checks; publish only through exact authorized release.","acceptance":"Actual patch/build/service artifact with test observations, dependencies and remaining deployment gaps; CLI exit success does not establish acceptance.","actual_availability":"Unestablished until actual grants, accounts/performers, materials, fee reservations and profile/capacity evidence are admitted."},{"named_job":"Testing it","procedure_ids":["company.cap11.v1","company.cap28.v1","company.cap29.v1"],"capability_contract_refs":["capabilities.json#/capabilities/10","capabilities.json#/capabilities/27","capabilities.json#/capabilities/28"],"adapter_route_ids":[],"intake":"Exact subject/version/predicates, independent evidence plan, fixed/fresh/adverse fixtures and permitted resources.","substantive_procedure":"Run deterministic, functional, rendered and appropriate stochastic checks; independent C06 captures failures, controls and full denominator.","acceptance":"Completed attributable assessment may be inconclusive/rejected; only exact current accepted child judgments satisfy product/launch predicates.","actual_availability":"Unestablished until actual grants, accounts/performers, materials, fee reservations and profile/capacity evidence are admitted."},{"named_job":"Running it once it exists","procedure_ids":["company.cap12.v1","company.cap30.v1","company.cap31.v1","company.cap36.v1","company.cap37.v1"],"capability_contract_refs":["capabilities.json#/capabilities/11","capabilities.json#/capabilities/29","capabilities.json#/capabilities/30","capabilities.json#/capabilities/35","capabilities.json#/capabilities/36"],"adapter_route_ids":["IC-PUBLIC","IC-HUMAN"],"intake":"Current launch readiness, verified pre-sale capacity, accepted agreement/service duties and admitted continuity.","substantive_procedure":"Release actual target, onboard entitled customer, perform each digital/human/physical milestone, monitor duties, repair incidents and reconcile outages.","acceptance":"Observed target and actual beneficiary service/acceptance, remaining milestones explicit; pre-sale rehearsal is not fulfillment of a customer order.","actual_availability":"Unestablished until actual grants, accounts/performers, materials, fee reservations and profile/capacity evidence are admitted."},{"named_job":"Finding the people who might want it","procedure_ids":["company.cap03.v1","company.cap05.v1","company.cap14.v1"],"capability_contract_refs":["capabilities.json#/capabilities/2","capabilities.json#/capabilities/4","capabilities.json#/capabilities/13"],"adapter_route_ids":["IC-SEARCH","IC-PUBLIC","IC-MAIL-OUT"],"intake":"Audience evidence, authorized query/contact policy and bounded distribution hypothesis.","substantive_procedure":"Discover permitted sources, create a qualified audience/channel plan, release useful assets/contact only to exact allowed recipients and record response.","acceptance":"Real eligible response with denominator, negative outcomes and suppression; search result counts or scraped addresses do not establish demand or contact rights.","actual_availability":"Unestablished until actual grants, accounts/performers, materials, fee reservations and profile/capacity evidence are admitted."},{"named_job":"Talking to them","procedure_ids":["company.cap0